{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-024":{"renderings":[{"id":"0a6c0509c05e1aaa","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-024"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Emphasizes that 'it is precisely Noun that ...', then adds a contrasting or additional point."},{"id":"1abd038758919de8","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-024"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"「Noun こそ～が」highlights the importance or uniqueness of the noun. It often translates as 'Yes, Noun is indeed ... , but ...'. The 'が' introduces a second, sometimes contrasting statement."},{"id":"82574bf37cbe476a","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-024"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Noun + こそ + (statement) + が + (contrasting/additional statement)"},{"id":"66648e7a04c57a4b","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-024"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"こそ～が: X, yes, but (値段こそ高いが)."},{"id":"d9af84a42d98e34b","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"koso"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Emphasis With こそ (Precisely / Only By)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"koso"}}]},"n1-024#60ebdc2d09a1":{"renderings":[{"id":"23751e42c9ea6c62","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-024"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Money is indeed necessary, but it isn't everything in life."}]},"n1-024#09e3f921bfc7":{"renderings":[{"id":"200a024f48814ee6","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-024"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Effort is certainly crucial, but results also matter."}]},"n1-024#fe0c77c7e5c4":{"renderings":[{"id":"01e2cc8c7573ad1e","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-024"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Health is indeed a treasure, but sometimes you have to prioritize work."}]},"n1-024#6e128cd8f7c9":{"renderings":[{"id":"8a90ad62a9edfd7f","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-024"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Love is certainly a powerful force, but it's difficult to express."}]}}}